    "slow_mandate": {
      "adds": "one inactive Draft capability Skill, in a fork",
      "program": "frozen to the probed program, operators and parameters alike",
      "observable_applicability": "fixed by the Runtime; Slow may not write it.  It decides when the Skill is retrieved, which is a different question from which served series it may treat",
